    "Feeds barrel rotation into Photoshop's Pen Tilt control by sending fake tilt data. Real tilt is suppressed while this is on. Use in Brush Dynamics → Shape Dynamics → Angle → Pen Tilt." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leitet die Barrel-Rotation in Photoshops Pen-Tilt-Steuerung um, indem es gefälschte Tilt-Daten sendet.  Echter Tilt wird deaktiviert, solange diese Option aktiv ist. Verwende sie unter Brush Dynamics → Shape Dynamics → Angle → Pen Tilt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
